    (uuid "99ab3e19-33ef-48be-8bd1-428b711d1c48")
  )
  (text "GPIO map (same as variant A, one firmware for both)\n  GPIO2 / GPIO3: USB host D+ / D- (PIO-USB, 22 ohm series).   GPIO4 / GPIO5: UART1 TX / RX through the isolator.\n  GPIO14 / GPIO15 / GPIO28 / GPIO29: SPI1 SCK / MOSI / MISO and card CS.   GPIO26: card detect.   GPIO6: external RGB LED (J6).\n  GPIO24: PC 1 VBUS sense (10k / 20k divider).   GPIO25: green status LED.\n\nPower domains\n  side A (GND_A): adapter (J1) and PC 1 VBUS (J4) are OR-ed by D2 / D3 into +5V_SYS_A, which feeds the USB host port (through F1),\n                  the RGB header and LDO U12 (+3V3_A, MCU-A, microSD). Neither source can back-feed the other.\n  side B (GND_B): PC 2 VBUS (J5) feeds LDO U52 (+3V3_B, MCU-B). The only link between the sides is the isolator U3.\n\nFirst flash: hold BOOTSEL, tap RESET, copy the .uf2 to the drive that appears. SWD pads (SWCLK, SWDIO, GND) for a debugger."
    (at 15.24 325.12 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "4073b08c-52fe-432c-873e-c7f089a83e98")
  )
